    {
      "text": "Are the transport facilities to your home very good?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.9
    },
    {
      "text": "It used to be good, because there was a subway station right near my home — I could just take the subway anywhere. But I recently moved to another place, and the transport has become much worse. Now I'm in a remote area: I have to take a bus first, then transfer to the subway station, and only then take the subway into the city. It's really not good.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 3.33,
      "end": 22.86
    }
